id: pm-github-aui0
title: Keep published dependency updates in the generated changelog
description: "Published dependency bullets disappear when a changelog entry point regenerates history without --dependency-updates. Every package changelog invocation must pass that flag, and a regression must fail if an entry point drops it."
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-11-24T00:47:00.326Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-24T00:53:11.219Z"
author: codex-agent
estimated_minutes: 30
acceptance_criteria: "Every package changelog entry point passes --dependency-updates, including delegated checks and the generator script that implements changelog:full.; Regeneration keeps the dependency bullets main already published, and a disposable revert of the flag fails the new regression."
comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-24T00:47:10.428Z",codex-agent,"changelog:full and changelog:check already pass --dependency-updates through scripts/generate-changelog.ts. release:notes invokes pm-changelog without the flag. The fix adds the flag there and a regression that fails if any changelog entry point drops it."
  "2026-11-24T00:52:40.861Z",codex-agent,"Regeneration with the existing generator flag restored 0 dependency bullets versus main; all 44 published dependency bullets remained. An otherwise identical unflagged invocation omitted 35 of those 44. release:notes was the package entry point missing the flag. The current release-notes window has no dependency bullets. Removing only that flag from the package scripts in a disposable copy fails the new regression with an assertion on release:notes. Typecheck, lint, privacy, changelog check, and the package changelog tests passed."
files[3]{path,scope}:
  package.json,project
  scripts/generate-changelog.ts,project
  test/release-workflow.test.ts,project
tests[3]{command,scope,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
  node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/release-workflow.test.ts,project,codex-agent,"2026-11-24T00:52:33.376Z",local_mutation,fix/changelog-keep-dependency-updates
  "npm run changelog:check",project,codex-agent,"2026-11-24T00:52:35.569Z",local_mutation,fix/changelog-keep-dependency-updates
  "npm run release:notes",project,codex-agent,"2026-11-24T00:52:38.581Z",local_mutation,fix/changelog-keep-dependency-updates
docs[1]{path,scope}:
  CHANGELOG.md,project
